OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric shopping area to get
OL,4,Afunding boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FFunds from a #700,000 pot are set to be
OL,7,Fspent on revitalising part of a town
OL,8,Fcentre in Derbyshire that dates back to
OL,9,Fthe late 12th Century.
OL,11,FChesterfield Borough Council said the
OL,12,Fmoney would be used to enhance the
OL,13,FShambles area and create a new grant
OL,14,Fscheme for businesses and landlords.
OL,16,FThe authority said the funding, which
OL,17,Fis part of the government's #5 billion
OL,18,FPride in Place programme, would bring
OL,19,Fthe area back to be a key "visitor
OL,20,Fdestination".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
