OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric shopping area to get
OL,4,Afunding boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Tricia Gilby, said:
OL,7,F"This project will ensure that the town
OL,8,Fcentre remains an attractive place to
OL,9,Fvisit and provides support to help
OL,10,Ftackle one of the issues that we know
OL,11,Fmatters to our community."
